If you're playing version 3.1.3, there should be some down stairs 
somewhere on level 33.  Keep looking.

A level teleport won't take you past the first level after the castle
(level 30 in your game).  If you really can't find the down stairs on 
level 33, try going to level 33, and then reading a cursed scroll of
teleportation, and level teleport down to level 34.  Then find both 
the down stairs and the up stairs.
